s.","limitations","guidance","list","Setup","ordered",true,"items",[73,74,75],"setup","Use a supported Windows/Linux release or follow the repository build instructions.","Start a local match with a fixed map, mode, bot count and difficulty.","Define a resettable objective and record screenshots, input timing and match results.","Try these tasks",false,[80,81,82],"testTasks","Measure target acquisition, navigation, survival and objective completion on a fixed map.","Modify a movement or weapon rule and verify the client/server match still runs.","Edit a test map and check spawn points, geometry, lighting and collision.","AI use and evaluation boundary","The open client/server allows controlled instrumentation. Preserve content attribution when sharing maps or visual datasets and evaluate against local bots or a dedicated test server.","aiUseNote","links","Supporting evidence",[90,91,92],"evidence",{"_54":97,"_25":98},{"_54":95,"_25":96},{"_54":93,"_25":94},"Code and content licensing","https://github.com/redeclipse/base/blob/master/doc/license.txt","Steam release and supported systems","https://store.steampowered.com/app/967460/Red_Eclipse/","Official source","https://github.com/redeclipse/base","Read the terms",[102],"licenseUrl",{"_54":99,"_25":94},"Terms category","Mixed code / asset licenses","terms","provenance","Asset license","Game content includes CC BY-SA and other licenses; consult the project license inventory.","assetLicense","Code license","zlib for project code; bundled components retain their notices.","codeLicense","Get started",[116],"access",{"_54":117,"_25":96,"_118":119},"Free Steam game","note","Free Steam release for Windows and Linux. Use a local match and fixed bot/map settings for evaluation.","Primary source",[123],"sourceUrl",{"_54":120,"_25":98},"Stack","C++ / first-person arena shooter / map editor","stack","Tracks",[130],"dimensions","3D","Testing goals",[134,135,136],"uses","Coding & automated playtests","Vision, control & planning","A